{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"數碼通部分地區網絡服務不穩　正積極跟進\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SMAR-TONE-261126-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】數碼通表示部分地區網絡服務不穩。</p><p>數碼通在社交平台向客戶致歉，稱留意到部分地區的網絡服務出現不穩定情況，現正積極調查及跟進，會盡力減低對客戶的影響，會適時公布最新消息。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:43:43.645287+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:21.869934+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:37:08.938136+00:00","content_hash":"d7733359440b8bea5bde031c1fba871bde542ad25ef9739aac2105457d65b215","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:43:43.645287+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}